  "moves": [
    "Walk forward from garden toward wooden steps, gently shift right to stair approach.",
    "Climb the wooden steps onto deck at eye level, ending with entrance left and outdoor table right.",
    "Move slowly across deck toward open lounge glass doorway, slight upward-right pan.",
    "Pass through the open glass doorway into lounge, turn gently toward sofa and kitchen until exact destination view. Do not pass through table or sofa.",
    "Step further into lounge, slowly pan right toward television keeping kitchen beyond.",
    "Continue small smooth rightward arc around coffee table, television wall becomes prominent.",
    "Walk through clear passage alongside sofa then rotate left to look back toward patio doors, showing stairway at left. No movement through furniture.",
    "Gently move toward kitchen side and pan right toward patio doors, sofa right, television left.",
    "Step backwards along clear passage toward breakfast bar, pan right across sofa.",
    "Turn right and walk around the breakfast bar into kitchen, finish facing sink and back door.",
    "Pivot smoothly left approximately 180 degrees within kitchen to look back toward lounge and stairway; keep cabinetry rigid.",
    "Small sidestep right within kitchen, gentle pan right revealing hob foreground."
